  - **Eco-Friendly Packaging**: Transitioning to sustainable packaging solutions, such as biodegradable materials or reusable containers, to reduce waste in landfills. This initiative not only aligns with environmental regulations but also meets growing consumer demand for sustainable products.

**17.2 Collaboration with Environmental Organizations**:  
- Both Parties shall engage with environmental organizations and NGOs to enhance their sustainability practices and contribute to broader environmental goals. This includes:  
